abstract: >
  PysternBlot is a GPLv3 Python GUI application for building
  publication-ready Western blot panels with hierarchical
  lane annotations. It supports ECL chemiluminescence and NIR
  fluorescence imaging (Cytiva Typhoon, LI-COR Odyssey) through
  a 16-bit image pipeline, with tools for image adjustment,
  cropping, rotation and multi-channel TIFF handling. For
  provenance it keeps a hash-chained operation log with
  tamper-evidence verification, generates integrity reports,
  binds archives to their project state with checksums, and
  detects clipped (saturated) regions in source images.
keywords:
